Children enter Thurlow CE VCP School during the academic year in which they have their fifth birthday. We have a Pupil Admission Number (PAN) of 15.
Most children transfer from local pre-schools and close liaison takes place between these establishments and with parents before children start school. This enables pre-school knowledge to be passed on to Early Years staff at Thurlow CE VCP and ensures that we have a very clear picture of a child’s needs before they start.
