A meeting for all new parents of children about to start in Early Years is held in the summer term.
Prospective and new parents are encouraged to attend the taster sessions and parent meetings that the school organises. This enables parents to find out through first-hand experience how children learn at Thurlow CE VCP School. If you would like to visit the school please contact the school office (01440 783281) to make an appointment.
